{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52393","headline":"回波乐 三十六 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 三十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"你今意况大聪，不语修道有功。\n亦无二边不着，亦复不住太空。\n衆生不解执有，只爲心里不通。\n迷人已南作北，又亦不[辨]（辩）西东。\n念个痴人学道，终日竟夜忩忩。\n只都（项校「覩」）小儿无智，何异世谛盲聋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}